            "review_title": "Review at Mr. BBQ & SsAm",
            "review_text": "Noah\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam65 contributions\n0\nBest Korean food for young people\nSep 2023 • Family\nI found this cozy restaurant which is attached in The Lotus Sauna Spa. They have a many yummy Korean foods. I swear that I can't forget the taste of their fried chicken. They also gave us free water and some banchan side dish.\nI even came back without the aim to join their Sauna 😂😂😂\n100% be on my favorite restaurants list.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2023",
